    "Name recordings with Apple Intelligence": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Name recordings with Apple Intelligence"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aufnahmen mit Apple Intelligence benennen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nombrar grabaciones con Apple Intelligence"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nommer les enregistrements avec Apple Intelligence"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Assegna nomi con Apple Intelligence"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligenceで収録に名前を付ける"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence로 녹화 이름 지정"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đặt tên bản ghi bằng Apple Intelligence"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用 Apple Intelligence 为录制命名"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nomear gravações com Apple Intelligence"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dar nomes às gravações com Apple Intelligence"}}}},
    "Uses the first 200 transcript words on this Mac. Otherwise, names use the capture type and time.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uses the first 200 transcript words on this Mac. Otherwise, names use the capture type and time."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verwendet die ersten 200 Transkriptwörter auf diesem Mac. Andernfalls werden Aufnahmetyp und Uhrzeit verwendet."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usa las primeras 200 palabras de la transcripción en este Mac. Si no, usa el tipo y la hora de captura."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Utilise les 200 premiers mots de la transcription sur ce Mac. Sinon, le nom indique le type et l’heure de capture."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usa le prime 200 parole della trascrizione su questo Mac. Altrimenti usa il tipo e l’ora di acquisizione."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このMacで文字起こしの最初の200語を使用します。それ以外の場合は収録の種類と時刻で命名します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 Mac에서 대본의 처음 200단어를 사용합니다. 그 외에는 캡처 유형과 시간으로 이름을 지정합니다."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dùng 200 từ đầu tiên của bản chép lời trên máy Mac này. Nếu không, dùng loại và thời gian ghi."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在这台 Mac 上使用转录的前 200 个词。否则使用录制类型和时间命名。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usa as primeiras 200 palavras da transcrição neste Mac. Caso contrário, usa o tipo e o horário da captura."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usa as primeiras 200 palavras da transcrição neste Mac. Caso contrário, usa o tipo e a hora da captura."}}}},
    "Apple Intelligence is ready.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence is ready."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence ist bereit."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence está listo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence est prêt."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence è pronto."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligenceを使用できます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence가 준비되었습니다."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence đã sẵn sàng."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Intelligence 已就绪。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O Apple Intelligence está pronto."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O Apple Intelligence está pronto."}}}},
    "Enable Apple Intelligence in System Settings. macOS downloads the model.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable Apple Intelligence in System Settings. macOS downloads the model."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktiviere Apple Intelligence in den Systemeinstellungen. macOS lädt das Modell herunter."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activa Apple Intelligence en Ajustes del Sistema. macOS descarga el modelo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activez Apple Intelligence dans Réglages Système. macOS télécharge le modèle."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Attiva Apple Intelligence in Impostazioni di Sistema. macOS scarica il modello."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"システム設定でApple Intelligenceを有効にしてください。macOSがモデルをダウンロードします。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시스템 설정에서 Apple Intelligence를 켜세요. macOS가 모델을 다운로드합니다."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bật Apple Intelligence trong Cài đặt hệ thống. macOS sẽ tải mô hình xuống."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在系统设置中启用 Apple Intelligence。macOS 会下载模型。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ative o Apple Intelligence nos Ajustes do Sistema. O macOS baixa o modelo."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ative o Apple Intelligence nas Definições do Sistema. O macOS descarrega o modelo."}}}},
    "macOS is preparing the Apple Intelligence model.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS is preparing the Apple Intelligence model."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS bereitet das Apple-Intelligence-Modell vor."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS está preparando el modelo de Apple Intelligence."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS prépare le modèle Apple Intelligence."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS sta preparando il modello Apple Intelligence."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOSがApple Intelligenceモデルを準備しています。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS가 Apple Intelligence 모델을 준비하고 있습니다."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS đang chuẩn bị mô hình Apple Intelligence."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 正在准备 Apple Intelligence 模型。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O macOS está preparando o modelo do Apple Intelligence."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O macOS está a preparar o modelo do Apple Intelligence."}}}},
    "This Mac does not support Apple Intelligence.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This Mac does not support Apple Intelligence."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dieser Mac unterstützt Apple Intelligence nicht."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Este Mac no es compatible con Apple Intelligence."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ce Mac ne prend pas en charge Apple Intelligence."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Questo Mac non supporta Apple Intelligence."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このMacはApple Intelligenceに対応していません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 Mac은 Apple Intelligence를 지원하지 않습니다."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Máy Mac này không hỗ trợ Apple Intelligence."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这台 Mac 不支持 Apple Intelligence。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Este Mac não é compatível com o Apple Intelligence."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Este Mac não suporta Apple Intelligence."}}}},
